/*
Open PMS - Dental: a new database.

Creates the 462 tables of a database at fork schema level 2026112451 (the Open Dental 26.2.0 schema and the
fork's), with the rows the program needs to start: preferences, definitions, user groups and permissions, the user Admin,
program links (all off) and procedure codes (named by their code only). No patients and no office data. Admin has a blank
password, which the program asks to set at the first logon. No third-party copyrighted content: no CDT descriptors, no
medical code system titles (ICD, CPT, SNOMED CT, LOINC and the others) and no vendor logos.

Load it into a new, empty database created with CHARACTER SET utf8mb3 (db/README.md). Nothing is dropped: in a database
that already has tables, loading stops at the first CREATE TABLE.

Generated from UnitTests/Resources/dump.txt by tools/New-InitSql.ps1 (DevDbTool --export-init-sql). Do not edit it by hand:
regenerate it after every new fork migration step.

Part of Open PMS - Dental, a fork of Open Dental. Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2.
See LICENSE and NOTICE in the repository root.
*/

